# reconcile-emit-report's starts of core/skills/ai-dlc-update/reconcile/emit-report.sh (BL-879 grammar), shard a
# only. Every other drive, the seed render included, is in process: seed.sh and run.sh load the subject once
# (lib/inproc.sh inproc_load) and call er_main through inproc_run. One cli cell per distinct CLI outcome (print
# mode exit 0; through the seam exit 0, 1, 3 and 2), each started as FXCELL=<id> bash "$EMIT" in rer_eqv() and
# compared byte for byte with the in-process call on the same input.
cli core/skills/ai-dlc-update/reconcile/emit-report.sh cli-render
cli core/skills/ai-dlc-update/reconcile/emit-report.sh cli-seam-pass
cli core/skills/ai-dlc-update/reconcile/emit-report.sh cli-seam-stale
cli core/skills/ai-dlc-update/reconcile/emit-report.sh cli-seam-resolved
cli core/skills/ai-dlc-update/reconcile/emit-report.sh cli-seam-refuse
